@page "/marten/query"
@using MartenStudio.Services.Settings
@inject StudioDescriptor Descriptor

@*
    The studio's Query page. The route is shared; the body is the descriptor's QueryComponent - MartenStudio's
    three-mode page (a Marten where clause, the SQL console, LINQ), or, in a studio with no document types, the
    shared SqlConsolePanel alone - and this page names no studio's component itself (design PS5, §2.5, §3.7).

    The body reads its deep link (?mode=, ?sql=, ...) with [SupplyParameterFromQuery] as it always did: query
    parameters are supplied to any component on the page, not only to the routed one, so a pasted link still
    reopens the same mode, type and text (D9).
*@

<DynamicComponent Type="@Descriptor.QueryComponent" />
